        ["## Contributions:\nIlly Does Things, Tsar and bizu for Bibo+.\nKorbo and Arcess for the pube textures and BPF framework.\nTsar for the vein normals.\nKrisan Thyme for IVCS.\nelegy for the preview layouts.\nAll my crash test bnuuys!\n\n**Join my Discord for any bug support, wips or just to hang out!**\nhttps://discord.gg/bnuuybooty\n\n**My ko-fi for custom made mods if you want to support me:**\nhttps://ko-fi.com/yetanothermodder/shop\n\n**My bsky for any extra bnuuy posting or upcoming releases:**\nhttps://bsky.app/profile/kejabnuuy.bsky.social\n\n*If you want to tag any screenshots with my mods please feel free to use **#yetanothermod**. \n___\n## Info:\n\n### **Important!**\n[Rue+](https://heliosphere.app/mod/rue) or [Bibo+](https://heliosphere.app/mod/bibo) is required for base textures. \n___\n\n**Yet Another Body+** aims to give feminine characters more muscular options as well as regular ones, on a custom high-poly mesh. The body is meant to be used in conjunction with **Customize+** scalers for intended looks, but these are not strictly necessary.\n\nThis body also comes with **[Yet Another Skeleton](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1l7G9gNFdMGjnvxm51zkoqRcC-leiZLrB9JMz62QM3Js/edit?usp=sharing)**. An IVCS2 based skeleton that is used to enable extra body physics and IVCS features. To use this skeleton's features you need to select the Yiggle models. Read the linked guide for more details.\n\n**For a softer option check out Elegy's Rue+:**\nhttps://heliosphere.app/mod/rue\n\n**For more tiddy variations check out Yet Another Tiddy+:**\nhttps://heliosphere.app/mod/tiddy\n\n**For more texture options I recommend installing Bibo+:**\nhttps://heliosphere.app/mod/bibo\n\n**Body features**:\n◽Uses Bibo+ UVs and is compatible with all B+ textures.\n◽High-poly body. Smoother torso, legs, butt, hands and feet.\n◽Regular and buff torso/legs.\n◽Larger butt, thighs, and calves.\n◽Three separate chest sizes with unique shapes.\n◽Yet Another Skeleton, Yiggle and physics.\n◽Support for [Better Pube Framework](https://www.xivmodarchive.com/modid/75292).\n\n\n**Includes:**\n▫️ **Large**, **Medium** and **Small** chest sizes. Optional buff torsos.\n▫️ **Watermelon** and **Skull Crusher** legs with three genitalia options.\n▫️ Small(er) butt options.\n▫️ Four nail lengths. Short, long, ballerina and stabbies. With variations!\n▫️ 5 custom nipple piercings and 2 navel ones.\n▫️ Custom feet with improved ankle weights.\n▫️ Embedded model offsets on feet for automatic usage with [Simple Heels](https://github.com/Caraxi/SimpleHeels)\n▫️ Customize+ scalers. Please see the extra files dropdown.\n▫️ Custom B+ normals for more defined muscles, and an alternative with some vascularity. Found in the variant dropdown.\n\n#### **Compatible underwear can be found [here](https://heliosphere.app/mod/ck5p4va7wx7w17yd3hrkqzemdc).**\n\n**Recommended Priority Order.**\n```\n0. Yet Another Body+\n1. Better Pube Framework (optional)\n1. Yet Another Piercing+\n1. Yet Another Undies+\n```\n***Customize+** is a Dalamud plugin that lets you apply body scaling at all times and gives you a lot of options for customizing your character. **Yet Another Body+** is meant to be used with the included ones for the intended look, but they can also serve as a template for creating your own.* \n\n*For support regarding C+, please visit their server:*\nhttps://discord.gg/KvGJCCnG8t\n\n**Notes:**\n▫️ Main preview uses the **Buff - Large** size, **Skull Crushers**, **Viera** scaling and the included normals. \n▫️ Freckles used are part of [Longerrpig's Ephelis skin textures]( https://ko-fi.com/s/ae119dac15).\n▫️ Buff arms are not vanilla compatible and will clip with some unmodded medium and long gloves.\n▫️ The custom **YAB+** normals are not gen3 compatible.\n▫️ YAS is compatible with IVCS/IVCS2 bodies.\n▫️ Except for hands and feet, Yiggle models are not compatible with other skeletons.\n\n**Future Plans:**\n▫️ All vanilla thighboots upscaled.\n▫️ Original Textures."] = "## 鸣谢：\n感谢 Illy Does Things、Tsar 和 bizu 制作 Bibo+。\n感谢 Korbo 和 Arcess 提供阴毛纹理与 BPF 框架。\n感谢 Tsar 提供血管法线贴图。\n感谢 Krisan Thyme 制作 IVCS。\n感谢 elegy 制作预览图排版。\n感谢所有帮忙测试的兔兔们！\n\n**需要反馈问题、查看制作进度，或想来聊天，欢迎加入我的 Discord！**\nhttps://discord.gg/bnuuybooty\n\n**如果想支持我或委托定制 Mod，可以访问我的 Ko-fi：**\nhttps://ko-fi.com/yetanothermodder/shop\n\n**更多兔兔动态与即将发布的作品，请关注我的 Bluesky：**\nhttps://bsky.app/profile/kejabnuuy.bsky.social\n\n*发布使用了我的 Mod 的截图时，欢迎使用 **#yetanothermod** 标签。\n___\n## 说明：\n\n### **重要！**\n需要安装 [Rue+](https://heliosphere.app/mod/rue) 或 [Bibo+](https://heliosphere.app/mod/bibo) 以提供基础纹理。\n___\n\n**Yet Another Body+** 使用定制的高面数模型，为女性角色提供肌肉型及常规体型。建议搭配 **Customize+** 体型缩放预设，以获得设计时的外观效果，但并非必须。\n\n本 Mod 还内含 **[Yet Another Skeleton](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1l7G9gNFdMGjnvxm51zkoqRcC-leiZLrB9JMz62QM3Js/edit?usp=sharing)**. 这是基于 IVCS2 的骨骼，用于启用额外的身体物理效果和 IVCS 功能。使用这些骨骼功能时，需要选择 Yiggle 模型。详细说明请阅读链接中的指南。\n\n**想要更柔和的体型，可以看看 Elegy 的 Rue+：**\nhttps://heliosphere.app/mod/rue\n\n**想要更多胸型，可以看看 Yet Another Tiddy+：**\nhttps://heliosphere.app/mod/tiddy\n\n**想要更多纹理选项，推荐安装 Bibo+：**\nhttps://heliosphere.app/mod/bibo\n\n**身体模型特点**：\n◽使用 Bibo+ 的 UV 布局，兼容所有 B+ 纹理。\n◽高面数身体模型，躯干、腿部、臀部、手脚更加平滑。\n◽提供常规及肌肉型躯干与腿型。\n◽臀部、大腿和小腿更加丰满。\n◽提供三种胸部尺寸，各有独立形状。\n◽支持 Yet Another Skeleton、Yiggle 和物理效果。\n◽支持 [Better Pube Framework](https://www.xivmodarchive.com/modid/75292).\n\n\n**包含内容：**\n▫️ **大胸**、**中胸**和**小胸**尺寸，以及可选的肌肉型躯干。\n▫️ **Watermelon Crushers（WC）**和**Skull Crushers（SC）**腿型，提供三种外生殖器形状。\n▫️ 小臀版本。\n▫️ 四种指甲长度／形状：短甲、长甲、芭蕾形甲和尖形甲，并提供不同变体。\n▫️ 五种定制乳头饰品及两种肚脐饰品。\n▫️ 定制脚型，改善了脚踝的骨骼权重。\n▫️ 脚部模型内置高度偏移，可由 [Simple Heels](https://github.com/Caraxi/SimpleHeels) 自动读取。\n▫️ Customize+ 体型缩放预设，请查看额外文件下拉列表。\n▫️ 定制 B+ 法线贴图，用于增强肌肉细节；另有带血管细节的版本，可在变体下拉列表中找到。\n\n#### **兼容的内衣可在 [这里](https://heliosphere.app/mod/ck5p4va7wx7w17yd3hrkqzemdc).**\n\n**推荐优先级顺序：**\n```\n0. Yet Another Body+\n1. Better Pube Framework（可选）\n1. Yet Another Piercing+\n1. Yet Another Undies+\n```\n***Customize+** 是卫月插件，可以持续应用身体缩放，并提供丰富的角色体型调整选项。**Yet Another Body+**